@api = http://localhost:5217

### Catálogo público
GET {{api}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=12

### Destacados
GET {{api}}/api/products/featured

### Categorías activas
GET {{api}}/api/categories

### Login admin (usuario del seed de desarrollo)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@decoartes3d.local", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Crear pedido como invitado
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingFirstName": "Ana",
  "shippingLastName": "García",
  "shippingEmail": "ana@example.com",
  "shippingAddress": "Calle Mayor 1",
  "shippingCity": "Madrid",
  "shippingState": "Madrid",
  "shippingPostalCode": "28001",
  "shippingCountry": "España",
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Health check
GET {{api}}/health
